On the {{bo25:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_arm1/n|int}} primary matches
({{bo25:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_years|first|d}}–{{bo25:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_years|last|d}}), blend − Alcaraz is
{{bo25:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_arm1/difference/match_weighted/log_loss|s4}}
{{bo25:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_arm1/intervals_95/log_loss/8|ci4}} and blend − BuildOak
{{bo25:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_buildoak/difference/match_weighted/log_loss|s4}}
{{bo25:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_buildoak/intervals_95/log_loss/8|ci4}}. Registered
({{bo:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_years|first|d}}–{{bo:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_years|last|d}},
{{bo:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_arm1/n|int}} matches):
{{bo:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_arm1/difference/match_weighted/log_loss|s4}}
{{bo:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_arm1/intervals_95/log_loss/8|ci4}} and
{{bo:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_buildoak/difference/match_weighted/log_loss|s4}}
{{bo:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_buildoak/intervals_95/log_loss/8|ci4}}.

The registered 2020–2024 test is the claim and stays so: its interval for blend − Alcaraz
included zero, the blend was not adopted, and no blend is released; the model is frozen
(D134). With 2025 added, the interval touches zero: its upper bound is
{{bo25:contrasts/contrast3_blend/primary_blend_minus_arm1/intervals_95/log_loss/8|last|s5}} under the registered seed,
and under {{bo25:readings/blend_interval_seed_sensitivity/alternative_seeds/n|word}} alternative seeds it is below zero only
{{bo25:readings/blend_interval_seed_sensitivity/alternative_seeds/upper_below_zero|word}} times (independent reconstruction). This is a
descriptive reading of one more exposed season, not a pass, and it changes neither decision.

